{
  "AND": {
    "left": {
      "raw_text": "- All patient have another dermatological disease",
      "Condition": [
        "dermatological disease"
      ]
    },
    "right": {
      "NOT": {
        "left": {
          "raw_text": ""
        }
      }
    }
  }
}

Note: Since there is only one eligibility criterion, the JSON format is relatively simple. The "AND" operator is used to combine the single criterion with a "NOT" operator that has an empty left operand, effectively making the entire expression equivalent to the single criterion.